Package: conceal-core
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Conceal Network command-line node and wallets
 Conceal Core provides the conceal-daemon node daemon, the conceal-wallet
 command-line wallet, the conceal-walletd payment gateway service, and the
 conceal-optimizer tool for the Conceal Network (CCX).
 .
 Installing the package does not start a service, create a wallet,
 download blockchain data, or open network ports. The binaries are
 built for generic x86-64 CPUs with AES-NI.
